# Working notes on the writing process, kept on disk and out of the published
# repository. The thesis cites this repository as the archive of the
# computational work, so what it serves is what an examiner reads; these files
# are the session-by-session process behind that work, not the work itself.
# Nothing in the thesis references any of them (offcuts.tex, which IS cited,
# stays tracked). Removing them here affects HEAD only: they remain in the Git
# history, and rewriting that is ruled out because main.pdf prints commit
# hashes in its computational audit.
claude.md
TASKS.md
REVIEW_STATUS.md
SIMPLIFIED_AI_PROOFS.md
